  <para style="h">Ezira</para>
  <para style="toc1">Igitabu ca Ezira</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ezira</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ezr</para>
  <para style="mt2">Igitabu ca</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ezira</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EZR 1" />
  <para style="s1">Kuro afasha abatwawe nk’inyagano gusubira iwabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 1:1" />Mu mwaka wa mbere Kuro ari umwami w’Ubuperesi, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kugira ngo ashitse ijambo yari yaravuze aciye kuri Yeremiya, akangura umutima wa Kuro umwami w’Ubuperesi na we atanga mu bwami bwiwe itegeko ryanditswe rivuga ngo:<verse eid="EZR 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 1:2" />“Ibi ni vyo Kuro umwami w’Ubuperesi avuze:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 1:2">‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana yo mw’ijuru, yampaye ubwami bwose bwo mw’isi kandi yantoranije ngo ndamwubakire Ingoro i Yerusalemu i Buyuda. <verse eid="EZR 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 1:3" />Umuntu wese wo mu bantu biwe ari muri mwebwe naduge i Yerusalemu i Buyuda yubake Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya Isirayeli, ari yo Mana iri i Yerusalemu. Imana yiwe ibane na we. <verse eid="EZR 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 1:4" />Kandi abantu bose babana n’abo bacitse kw’icumu babahe inzahabu, ifeza, n’ubundi butunzi n’imikuku, hamwe n’ivyo umuntu ashikana avyishakiye ku bw’iyo Ngoro y’Imana i Yerusalemu.’ ”<verse eid="EZR 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 1:5" />Nuko abakuru b’imiryango y’Abayuda n’Ababenyamini, n’abaherezi hamwe n’Abalewi, n’umuntu wese Imana yakoze ku mutima, bitegurira kuduga ngo bubake Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="EZR 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 1:6" />Ababanyi babo bose babafashisha ibikoresho vy’ifeza, vy’inzahabu, ubundi butunzi n’imikuku, n’izindi ngabire z’agaciro, vyiyongera ku mashikanwa abantu batanze n’umutima ubikunze.<verse eid="EZR 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 1:7" />Vyongeye, umwami Kuro asohora ibikoresho vyakora mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ivyo Nebukadineza yari yaranyaze abikuye i Yerusalemu akabishira mu ngoro y’ikigirwamana ciwe. <verse eid="EZR 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 1:8" />Kuro umwami w’i Buperesi yari yarabitumye Mitiredati umuzezwabintu, na we arabiharura abishikiriza Sheshubazari umuganwa w’i Buyuda.<verse eid="EZR 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 1:9" />Uru ni urutonde hamwe n’ibitigiri vyavyo:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 1:9" />
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 1:9">amasiniya y’inzahabu mirongo itatu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 1:9">amasiniya y’ifeza igihumbi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 1:9">amapanu y’ifeza mirongo ibiri n’icenda,<verse eid="EZR 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 1:10" />ibikombe vy’inzahabu mirongo itatu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 1:10">ibikombe bitobito vy’ifeza amajana ane na cumi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 1:10">n’ibindi bikoresho igihumbi.<verse eid="EZR 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 1:11" />Vyose na vyose, vyari ibikoresho ibihumbi bitanu n’amajana ane vy’inzahabu n’ifeza.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 1:11" />
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 1:11">Sheshubazari azana ivyo vyose ari kumwe n’abavuye mu kinyago batashe bavuye i Babiloni baja i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="EZR 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EZR 2" />
  <para style="s1">Urutonde rw’abatashe bavuye mu kinyago</para>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 2:1" />Uru ni rwo rutonde rw’abantu bo muri iyo ntara baduze bavuye mu kinyago, abo Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni yari yarajanye nk’inyagano i Babiloni. Abo ni bo bagarutse i Yerusalemu n’i Buyuda, umwe wese aca aja mu gisagara c’iwabo. <verse eid="EZR 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 2:2" />Bari baherekejwe na Zerubabeli, Yesuwa, Nehemiya, Seraya, Reyelayiya, Moridekayi, Bilushani, Misipari, Bigivayi, Rehumu na Bayana.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 2:2" />
  <para style="lh" vid="EZR 2:2">Urutonde rw’abagabo bo mu Bisirayeli ni uru:<verse eid="EZR 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 2:3" />Abakomoka kuri Paroshi ni ibihumbi bibiri n’ijana na mirongo indwi na babiri.<verse eid="EZR 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 2:4" />Abakomoka kuri Shefatiya, ni amajana atatu na mirongo indwi na babiri.<verse eid="EZR 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 2:5" />Abakomoka kuri Ara ni amajana indwi na mirongo indwi na batanu.<verse eid="EZR 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 2:6" />Abakomoka kuri Pahati-Mowabu (biciye kuri Yesuwa na Yowabu) ni ibihumbi bibiri n’amajana umunani na cumi na babiri.<verse eid="EZR 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 2:7" />Abakomoka kuri Elamu ni igihumbi n’amajana abiri na mirongo itanu na bane.<verse eid="EZR 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 2:8" />Abakomoka kuri Zatu ni amajana icenda na mirongo ine na batanu.<verse eid="EZR 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 2:9" />Abakomoka kuri Zakayi ni amajana indwi na mirongo itandatu.<verse eid="EZR 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 2:10" />Abakomoka kuri Bani ni amajana atandatu na mirongo ine na babiri.<verse eid="EZR 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 2:11" />Abakomoka kuri Bebayi ni amajana atandatu na mirongo ibiri na batatu.<verse eid="EZR 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 2:12" />Abakomoka kuri Azigadi ni igihumbi n’amajana abiri na mirongo ibiri na babiri.<verse eid="EZR 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 2:13" />Abakomoka kuri Adonikamu ni amajana atandatu na mirongo itandatu na batandatu.<verse eid="EZR 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 2:14" />Abakomoka kuri Bigivayi ni ibihumbi bibiri na mirongo itanu na batandatu.<verse eid="EZR 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 2:15" />Abakomoka kuri Adini ni amajana ane na mirongo itanu na bane.<verse eid="EZR 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 2:16" />Abakomoka kuri Ateri, biciye kuri Hezekiya ni mirongo icenda n’umunani.<verse eid="EZR 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 2:17" />Abakomoka kuri Bezayi ni amajana atatu na mirongo ibiri na batatu.<verse eid="EZR 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 2:18" />Abakomoka kuri Yorahi ni ijana na cumi na babiri.<verse eid="EZR 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 2:19" />Abakomoka kuri Hashumi ni amajana abiri na mirongo ibiri na batatu.<verse eid="EZR 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 2:20" />Abakomoka kuri Gibari ni mirongo icenda na batanu.<verse eid="EZR 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 2:21" />Abantu b’i Betelehemu ni ijana na mirongo ibiri na batatu.<verse eid="EZR 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 2:22" />Abantu b’i Netofa ni mirongo itanu na batandatu.<verse eid="EZR 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 2:23" />Ab’i Anatoti ni ijana na mirongo ibiri n’umunani.<verse eid="EZR 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 2:24" />Ab’i Azimaveti ni mirongo ine na babiri.<verse eid="EZR 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 2:25" />Ab’i Kiriyati-Yeyarimu, Kefira na Beroti ni amajana indwi na mirongo ine na batatu.<verse eid="EZR 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 2:26" />Ab’i Rama n’i Geba ni amajana atandatu na mirongo ibiri n’umwe.<verse eid="EZR 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 2:27" />Ab’i Mikimashi ni ijana na mirongo ibiri na babiri.<verse eid="EZR 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 2:28" />Ab’i Beteli n’i Hayi ni amajana abiri na mirongo ibiri na batatu.<verse eid="EZR 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 2:29" />Ab’i Nebo ni mirongo itanu na babiri.<verse eid="EZR 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 2:30" />Ab’i Magibishi ni ijana na mirongo itanu na batandatu.<verse eid="EZR 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 2:31" />Ab’i Elamu handi ni igihumbi n’amajana abiri na mirongo itanu na bane.<verse eid="EZR 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 2:32" />Abakomoka kuri Harimu ni amajana atatu na mirongo ibiri.<verse eid="EZR 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 2:33" />Abakomoka kuri Lodi, Hadidi na Ono ni amajana indwi na mirongo ibiri na batanu.<verse eid="EZR 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 2:34" />Ab’i Yeriko ni amajana atatu na mirongo ine na batanu.<verse eid="EZR 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 2:35" />Abakomoka kuri Senaya ni ibihumbi bitatu n’amajana atandatu na mirongo itatu.<verse eid="EZR 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 2:36" />Abaherezi:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 2:36">Abakomoka kuri Yedaya biciye mu muryango wa Yesuwa ni amajana icenda na mirongo indwi na batatu.<verse eid="EZR 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 2:37" />Abakomoka kuri Imeri ni igihumbi na mirongo itanu na babiri.<verse eid="EZR 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 2:38" />Abakomoka kuri Pashuri ni igihumbi n’amajana abiri na mirongo ine n’indwi.<verse eid="EZR 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 2:39" />Abakomoka kuri Harimu ni igihumbi na cumi n’indwi.<verse eid="EZR 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 2:40" />Abalewi:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 2:40">abakomoka kuri Yesuwa biciye kuri Kadimiyeli mu ruvyaro rwa Hodaviya ni mirongo indwi na bane.<verse eid="EZR 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 2:41" />Abacuraranzi:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 2:41">abakomoka kuri Asafu ni ijana na mirongo ibiri n’umunani.<verse eid="EZR 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 2:42" />Abarinzi b’irembo ry’urusengero:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 2:42">abakomoka kuri Shalumu, Ateri, Talumoni,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 2:42">Akubu, Hatita na Shobayi ni ijana na mirongo itatu n’icenda.<verse eid="EZR 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 2:43" />Abakozi bo mu Ngoro:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 2:43">abakomoka kuri Ziha, Hasufa, Tabawoti,<verse eid="EZR 2:43" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 2:44" />Kerosi, Siyaha, Padoni,<verse eid="EZR 2:44" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZR 2:45" />Lebana, Hagaba, Akubu,<verse eid="EZR 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZR 2:46" />Hagabu, Shamulayi, Hanani,<verse eid="EZR 2:46" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZR 2:47" />Gideli, Gahari, Reyaya,<verse eid="EZR 2:47" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZR 2:48" />Rezini, Nekoda, Gazamu,<verse eid="EZR 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZR 2:49" />Uza, Paseya, Besayi,<verse eid="EZR 2:49" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="EZR 2:50" />Asina, Meyunimu, Nefusimu,<verse eid="EZR 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="EZR 2:51" />Bakibuki, Hakufa, Harihuri,<verse eid="EZR 2:51" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="EZR 2:52" />Baziluti, Mehida, Harisha,<verse eid="EZR 2:52" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="EZR 2:53" />Barikosi, Sisera, Tema,<verse eid="EZR 2:53" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="EZR 2:54" />Neziya na Hatifa.<verse eid="EZR 2:54" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="EZR 2:55" />Abakomoka ku bakozi ba Salomo:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 2:55">abakomoka kuri</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 2:55">Sotayi, Hasofereti, Peruda,<verse eid="EZR 2:55" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="EZR 2:56" />Yayala, Darukoni, Gideli,<verse eid="EZR 2:56" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="EZR 2:57" />Shefatiya, Hatili,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 2:57">Pokereti-Hazebayimu na Ami.<verse eid="EZR 2:57" /></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="EZR 2:58" />Abakozi bo mu Ngoro n’abakomoka ku bakozi ba Salomo bose hamwe ni amajana atatu na mirongo icenda na babiri.<verse eid="EZR 2:58" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="EZR 2:59" />Aba bakurikira baduze bavuye mu bisagara vya Teli-Melahi, Teli-Harusha, Kerubi, Adoni na Imeri, ariko ntibashoboye kwerekana ko imiryango yabo ikomoka ku Bisirayeli.<verse eid="EZR 2:59" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="EZR 2:60" />Abakomoka kuri Delaya, Tobiya na Nekoda ni amajana atandatu na mirongo itanu na babiri.<verse eid="EZR 2:60" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="EZR 2:61" />Mu baherezi:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 2:61">abakomoka kuri</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 2:61">Habaya, Hakozi na Baruzilayi (umugabo yari yarongoye umukobwa wa Baruzilayi Umunyagileyadi agaca yitirirwa iryo zina nyene).<verse eid="EZR 2:61" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="EZR 2:62" />Abo ni bo barondeye intonde za ba sekuruza b’imiryango yabo, ariko ntibashobora kuzironka, maze baca bakurwa mu gikorwa c’ubuherezi nk’abahumanye. <verse eid="EZR 2:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="EZR 2:63" />Umukuru w’intara, aca abategeka kutarya ivyejejwe gushika haje umuherezi agasiguza Uhoraho akoresheje Urimu na Tumimu.<verse eid="EZR 2:63" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="EZR 2:64" />Igitigiri c’abantu bose cari ibihumbi mirongo ine na bibiri n’amajana atatu na mirongo itandatu, <verse eid="EZR 2:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="EZR 2:65" />ukuyemwo ibihumbi indwi n’amajana atatu na mirongo itatu n’indwi vy’abagurano n’abaguranokazi; kandi bari bafise abagabo n’abagore b’abaririmvyi amajana abiri. <verse eid="EZR 2:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="EZR 2:66" />Bari bafise amafarasi amajana indwi na mirongo itatu n’atandatu, inyumbu amajana abiri na mirongo ine na zitanu, <verse eid="EZR 2:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="EZR 2:67" />ingamiya amajana ane na mirongo itatu na zitanu n’indogoba ibihumbi bitandatu n’amajana indwi na mirongo ibiri.<verse eid="EZR 2:67" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="EZR 2:68" />Bamaze gushika ku Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> i Yerusalemu, bamwe bo mu bakuru b’imiryango batanga amashikanwa bavyishakiye kugira ngo aze yubake Ingoro y’Imana aho yahora. <verse eid="EZR 2:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="EZR 2:69" />Bakurikije uburyo bafise, batanze mu bubiko bw’iki gikorwa ingero dariki ibihumbi mirongo itandatu n’imwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:69 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 500.</char></note> z’inzahabu, ingero mina ibihumbi bitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:69 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amatoni 3.</char></note> z’ifeza, n’impuzu z’abaherezi ijana.<verse eid="EZR 2:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="EZR 2:70" />Abaherezi, Abalewi, abarinzi b’irembo, abaririmvyi n’abakozi bo mu Ngoro, bari kumwe n’abandi bantu hamwe n’Abisirayeli bose baja kuba mu bisagara vyabo.<verse eid="EZR 2:70" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EZR 3" />
  <para style="s1">Basanura igicaniro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 3:1" />Ukwezi kw’indwi gushitse, Abisirayeli bamaze gushika mu bisagara vyabo, abantu bakoranira hamwe i Yerusalemu nk’umuntu umwe. <verse eid="EZR 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 3:2" />Maze Yesuwa mwene Yozadaki na bagenziwe b’abaherezi na Zerubabeli mwene Sheyalutiyeli n’abo bari bafatanije batangura kwubaka igicaniro c’Imana y’Abisirayeli kugira ngo bashobore gushikana ibimazi bituririrwa kuri co, nk’uko vyari vyanditswe mu Vyagezwe vya Mose umuntu w’Imana. <verse eid="EZR 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 3:3" />Naho bari bafise ubwoba kubera gutinya amahanga yari abakikije, barubatse igicaniro kw’itanguriro ryaco baca bagitangirako ibimazi vyo guturirwa n’umuriro, babishikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, vyaba ivyo mu gitondo canke ivyo ku mugoroba. <verse eid="EZR 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 3:4" />Maze nk’uko vyari vyanditswe, bahimbaza umusi mukuru w’insago, batanga igitigiri c’ibimazi vyo guturirwa n’umuriro nk’uko vyasabwa ku musi ku musi. <verse eid="EZR 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 3:5" />Inyuma y’ivyo, baca bashikana ibimazi vyo guturirwa bisanzwe bitangwa, ibimazi vyo mu mboneko z’ukwezi n’ibimazi vy’imisi mikuru y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yose yategetswe, hamwe n’ivyazanywe n’umuntu wese ashikaniye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avyishakiye. <verse eid="EZR 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 3:6" />Ku musi wa mbere w’ukwezi kw’indwi batangura gushikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ibimazi vyo guturirwa n’umuriro, naho itanguriro ry’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ritari bwashirweho.<verse eid="EZR 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bubaka Ingoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 3:7" />Nuko baha amahera abubatsi n’ababaji, baha abantu b’i Sidoni n’i Tiro ivyokurya, ibinyobwa n’amavuta kugira ngo bazane ibiti vy’amasederi babikuye i Libani gushika i Yopa, babicishije mu kiyaga, nk’uko vyari vyaremewe n’umwami Kuro w’i Buperesi.<verse eid="EZR 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 3:8" />Mu kwezi kwa kabiri kw’umwaka ugira kabiri kuva bashitse i Yerusalemu ahari Ingoro y’Imana, Zerubabeli mwene Sheyalutiyeli, Yesuwa mwene Yozadaki na benewabo basigaye b’abaherezi n’Abalewi n’abari bagarutse i Yerusalemu bavuye mu kinyago, batangura igikorwa. Bashiraho Abalewi bamaze imyaka mirongo ibiri n’iyirenga ngo bakurikirane igikorwa co gusanura Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="EZR 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 3:9" />Yesuwa n’abahungu biwe n’abo bavukana, Kadimiyeli n’abahungu biwe (bakomoka kuri Hodaviya), abahungu ba Henadadi n’abahungu babo n’abo bavukana, bose bakaba bari Abalewi, barifatanya kugira ngo bashobore gukurikirana abakozi bariko barakora ku Ngoro y’Imana.<verse eid="EZR 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 3:10" />Abubatsi bamaze gushiraho itanguriro ry’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, abaherezi bambaye ya myambaro yabo bafise n’inzamba, n’Abalewi, bene Asafu bafise n’ivyuma bisama, bafata ibibanza vyabo ngo bahimbaze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, nk’uko vyashinzwe na Dawidi umwami w’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="EZR 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 3:11" />Baririmbira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> indirimbo zo gutazira no gushima bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZR 3:11">“Ni mwiza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZR 3:11">urukundo akunda Abisirayeli rwamaho ibihe bidashira.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZR 3:11">Maze abantu bose barasemerera cane bahimbaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, kuko itanguriro ry’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryari rimaze kwubakwa. <verse eid="EZR 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 3:12" />Ariko benshi mu baherezi n’Abalewi n’abakuru b’imiryango bashaje, bari barabonye Ingoro ya mbere, bararira cane babonye itanguriro ry’iyo Ngoro yindi ririko rirubakwa, mu gihe abandi na bo bariko baravuza urwamo kubera umunezero. <verse eid="EZR 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 3:13" />Nta n’umwe yashobora gutandukanya akamo k’umunezero n’ijwi ry’abarira, kuko abantu basemerera cane rwose. Kandi urwamo rwarumvikana umuntu akiri kure.<verse eid="EZR 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EZR 4" />
  <para style="s1">Bagwanya abariko barubaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 4:1" />Abansi b’Abayuda n’Ababenyamini bumvise ko abahora ari inyagano bariko barubaka Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana y’Abisirayeli, <verse eid="EZR 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 4:2" />baraza bashikira Zerubabeli n’abakuru baserukira imiryango bababwira bati: “Reka tubafashe kwubaka kuko na twebwe dusenga Imana yanyu, kandi twamye tuyishikanira ibimazi kuva mu gihe ca Esaruhadoni umwami w’i Ashuri, ari we yatuzanye hano.”<verse eid="EZR 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 4:3" />Ariko Zerubabeli, Yesuwa n’abandi bose bo mu bakuru b’imiryango y’Abisirayeli babishura bati: “Nta co dusangiye mu kwubaka Ingoro y’Imana yacu. Ni twebwe twenyene tuzoyubakira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana y’Abisirayeli, nk’uko umwami Kuro, umwami w’i Buperesi, yadutegetse.”<verse eid="EZR 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 4:4" />Nuko amahanga yari abakikije akura hasi ngo ace intege Abayuda abatera n’ubwoba ngo ntibashishikare kwubaka. <verse eid="EZR 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 4:5" />Barondera abakozi b’ubwo bwami babaha impera kugira ngo babagwanye. Ivyo vyatumye imigambi yabo idatera imbere mu gihe cose umwami Kuro w’i Buperesi yamaze ari ku ngoma gushika no ku ngoma y’umwami Dariyusi w’i Buperesi.<verse eid="EZR 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abandi babagwanije ku ngoma ya Ahasuwerusi na Aritazeruzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 4:6" />Igihe Ahasuwerusi yari akija ku ngoma, abansi b’Abayuda banditse ikete ryo kwagiriza Abayuda n’ab’i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="EZR 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 4:7" />Maze mu misi ya Ahasuwerusi umwami w’i Buperesi, Bishulamu, Mituredati, Tabeyeli n’abandi bari bafatanije bandikira Ahasuwerusi. Iryo kete ryari ryanditswe mu rurimi rw’Icarameya hanyuma bararisobanurira umwami.<verse eid="EZR 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 4:8" />Rehumu umukuru w’ingabo na Shimushayi umunyamabanga bandikira umwami Aritazeruzi ikete ryo kwagiriza ab’i Yerusalemu rivuga riti:<verse eid="EZR 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 4:9" />Rehumu umukuru w’ingabo na Shimushayi umunyamabanga, hamwe n’abandi dufatanije, abacamanza n’abakuru batwara abantu baturuka i Tiriporisi, i Buperesi, i Babiloni hamwe n’abantu bava i Ereki n’i Susa, ari bo Banyalamu. <verse eid="EZR 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 4:10" />Barongera kandi barungika n’indamukanyo z’abantu umwubahwa Ashurubanipali yatwaye akabashira mu gisagara c’i Samariya n’ahandi muri iyo ntara iri mu burengero bw’uruzi Efurate.<verse eid="EZR 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 4:11" />Iyi ni ikopi y’iryo kete banditse.</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 4:11">Ku mwami Aritazeruzi,</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 4:11">Bivuye ku basavyi bawe, abantu bo mu burengero bw’uruzi Efurate:<verse eid="EZR 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 4:12" />Umwami yomenya neza ko Abayuda baduze baza iwacu bavuye iwanyu bashikiye i Yerusalemu kandi bariko barubaka ca gisagara kigarariza kandi gikora ibibi. Bariko barasanura impome basubiramwo amatanguriro.<verse eid="EZR 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 4:13" />Vyongeye, umwami akwiye kumenya ko ico gisagara nicubakwa inzitiro zaco zigasanurwa, ata matagisi, ivyagerewe umwami canke ikori bizosubira gutangwa, kandi ubutunzi bw’umwami buzogira ingorane. <verse eid="EZR 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 4:14" />None rero kubera yuko twubaha ikirimba kandi akaba atari vyiza kureka umwami ngo akengerwe, twandikiye ubu butumwa umwami kugira ngo tubimumenyeshe, <verse eid="EZR 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 4:15" />hanyuma hakorwe amatohoza mu vyanditswe bivuga ivyabaye ku ngoma z’Abakwitangiye imbere. Muri ivyo vyanditswe uzosanga ico gisagara ari igisagara c’abagarariji, bakunda gutera umudugararo ku bami n’abatwara intara, abantu bamye bagarariza kuva kera. Ni co gituma ico gisagara cari carasambuwe. <verse eid="EZR 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 4:16" />Tumenyesheje umwami ko ico gisagara nicubakwa inzitiro zaho zigasanurwa, ata co uzoba ugisigaranye mu ntara yo mu burengero bw’uruzi Efurate.<verse eid="EZR 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 4:17" />Umwami yishura ati:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 4:17">Kuri Rehumu umukuru w’ingabo, Shimushayi umunyamabanga n’abandi bose mufatanije baba i Samariya n’ahandi hose mu ntara yo hakurya y’uruzi Efurate:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 4:17">Ndabaramukije.<verse eid="EZR 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 4:18" />Ikete mwaturungikiye ryarasomwe kandi ryahinduriwe mu rurimi imbere yanje. <verse eid="EZR 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 4:19" />Naratanze itegeko maze hakorwa amatohoza, dusanga ko ico gisagara gifise kahise ko kugarariza abami kandi ko camye kibamwo imigumuko. <verse eid="EZR 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 4:20" />I Yerusalemu harigeze kugira abami bakomeye batwaye intara yose yo mu buseruko bw’uruzi Efurate, amatagisi, amashikanwa yo kwisaba n’ayandi makori vyahabwa bo. <verse eid="EZR 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 4:21" />None rero nimutumeko abo bantu mubategeke guhagarika ico gikorwa, kugira ngo ico gisagara ntigisubire kwubakwa kugeza ntanze irindi tegeko. <verse eid="EZR 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 4:22" />Mwitonde kugira ngo ntimufate minenerwe ico kibazo. Ni igiki cotuma iyi ngorane ikura, ikageramira inyungu z’ubwami?<verse eid="EZR 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 4:23" />Iyo kopi y’ikete ry’umwami Aritazeruzi rigisomewe Rehumu na Shimushayi umunyamabanga n’abo bari bafatanije, baca bihuta kuja ku Bayuda bari i Yerusalemu babategeka guhagarika ku nguvu ivyo bariko barakora.<verse eid="EZR 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 4:24" />Nuko igikorwa co kwubaka Ingoro y’Imana i Yerusalemu kiba kirahagaze kugeza mu mwaka ugira kabiri umwami Dariyusi w’i Buperesi ari ku ngoma.<verse eid="EZR 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EZR 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ikete Tatenayi yandikiye Dariyusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 5:1" />Muri ico gihe Hagayi na Zakariya mwene Ido, abavugishwa n’Imana, baravugishwa babwira Abayuda bari i Buyuda n’i Yerusalemu mw’izina ry’Imana y’Abisirayeli, ari yo yari ibarongoye. <verse eid="EZR 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 5:2" />Maze Zerubabeli mwene Sheyalutiyeli na Yesuwa mwene Yozadaki barahaguruka ngo bongere gusanura Ingoro y’Imana y’i Yerusalemu. Kandi abavugishwa b’Imana bari kumwe na bo, ngo babafashe.<verse eid="EZR 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 5:3" />Ico gihe nyene Tatenayi, umukuru w’intara yo mu burengero bw’uruzi Efurate, na Shetari Bozenayi n’abo bari bafatanije baja aho bari barababaza bati: “Ni nde yabahaye uruhusha rwo gusubira kwubaka iyi Ngoro no gusanura aha hantu?” <verse eid="EZR 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 5:4" />Bongera barababaza bati: “Ni ba nde bariko barubaka iyi nzu?” <verse eid="EZR 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 5:5" />Ariko kubera inyonga z’Imana yabo zari kuri abo barongozi b’Abayuda, ntibahagaritse igikorwa kugeza bishikiriye Dariyusi na we akabishura kandi ikete ryiwe rikabashikira.<verse eid="EZR 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 5:6" />Iyi ni ikopi y’ikete Tatenayi, umukuru w’intara yo mu burengero bw’uruzi Efurate, na Shetari Bozenayi n’abari kumwe na bo, abakuru bo mu burengero bw’uruzi Efurate, barungikiye umwami Dariyusi. <verse eid="EZR 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 5:7" />Raporo bamurungikiye ni yo y’iyi:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 5:7">Ku mwami Dariyusi,</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 5:7">Turabaramukije bivuye ku mutima.<verse eid="EZR 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 5:8" />Umwami yomenya neza ko twagiye mu ntara y’i Buyuda, ku Ngoro y’Imana nkuru. Abantu bariko barayubakisha amabuye maninimanini bashirako n’imbaho mu bihome. Ico gikorwa kiriko kirabandanya ata ngorane kandi kiriko kiratera kija imbere kirongowe na bo.<verse eid="EZR 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 5:9" />Twarabajije abarongozi tuti: “Ni nde yabahaye uruhusha rwo gusubira kwubaka Ingoro no gusanura aho hantu? <verse eid="EZR 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 5:10" />Kandi twarababajije n’amazina, kugira ngo tuyakwandikire umenye amazina y’abarongozi babo.”<verse eid="EZR 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 5:11" />Iyi ni yo nyishu baduhaye:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 5:11" />
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 5:11">“Turi abasavyi b’Imana y’ijuru n’isi, kandi turiko turasanura Ingoro yari yarubatswe mu myaka myinshi yarenganye, imwe umwami ahambaye wa Isirayeli yari yarubatse akayirangiza. <verse eid="EZR 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 5:12" />Maze kubera ko ba sogokuruza bashavuje Imana yo mw’ijuru, vyatumye ibagabura mu maboko ya Nebukadineza Umukaludaya, umwami w’i Babiloni, ari we yasambuye iyi Ngoro agatwara abantu nk’inyagano i Babiloni.<verse eid="EZR 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 5:13" />Ariko, mu mwaka wa mbere Kuro umwami w’i Babiloni agiye ku ngoma, umwami yatanze itegeko ryo gusubira kwubaka Ingoro y’Imana. <verse eid="EZR 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 5:14" />Yarongeye akura mu ngoro y’i Babiloni ibikoresho vy’inzahabu n’ivy’ifeza vyahoze mu Ngoro y’Imana, ivyo Nebukadineza yari yaranyaze abikuye mu Ngoro i Yerusalemu akabijana mu ngoro i Babiloni. Nuko umwami Kuro abiha umuntu yitwa Sheshubazari, uwo yari yagenye ngo abe umukuru w’intara, <verse eid="EZR 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 5:15" />kandi aramubwira ati: ‘Fata ibi bikoresho ubijane ubisubize mu Ngoro y’Imana i Yerusalemu, kandi ize yubakwe mu kibanza yahozemwo.’<verse eid="EZR 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 5:16" />Nuko uwo Sheshubazari araza ashiraho amatanguriro y’Ingoro y’Imana i Yerusalemu. Kuva ico gihe kugeza uwu musi iracubakwa ntirahera.<verse eid="EZR 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 5:17" />None rero nivyaba bihimbaye umwami, nihagirwe itohoza mu vyanditswe vyabaye biri i Babiloni kugira ngo murabe koko ko umwami Kuro yoba yaratanze iryo tegeko ryo gusubira kwubaka Ingoro y’Imana i Yerusalemu. Maze umwami ace aturungikira ico azoba ategetse ku vyerekeye ico kibazo.”<verse eid="EZR 5:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EZR 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ingingo ya Dariyusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 6:1" />Umwami Dariyusi araheza atanga itegeko, avuga ko barondera mu bitabu bivuga ivyabaye, vyari mu bubiko bw’i Babiloni. <verse eid="EZR 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 6:2" />Hatorwa umuzingo mu munara wa Ekubatana mu ntara ya Medi, uwo na wo ukaba wari wanditswemwo ngo:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 6:2">Icibutso:<verse eid="EZR 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 6:3" />Mu mwaka wa mbere umwami Kuro ari ku ngoma yasohoye itegeko ryerekeye Ingoro y’Imana i Yerusalemu rivuga ngo:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 6:3" />
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 6:3">“Ingoro nisubire kwubakwa ahantu Abayuda bahora batangira ibimazi, kandi amatanguriro yayo niyubakwe. Izoba ifise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo itandatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 27.</char></note> z’uburebure n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo itandatu z’ubwaguke, <verse eid="EZR 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 6:4" />yubakishijwe n’imirongo ibiri y’amabuye maninimanini n’umurongo umwe w’imbaho. Amahera yose akenewe azova mu butunzi bw’i bwami. <verse eid="EZR 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 6:5" />Kandi, ibikoresho vy’inzahabu n’ivy’ifeza vyo mu Ngoro y’Imana, ivyo Nebukadineza yanyaze abikuye mu ngoro i Yerusalemu akabitwara i Babiloni, bize bisubizwe mu bibanza vyavyo mu Ngoro i Yerusalemu, bishirwe mu Nzu y’Imana.”<verse eid="EZR 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 6:6" />Maze umwami Dariyusi aca arungika ubu butumwa: Nuko rero, Tatenayi, umukuru w’intara yo mu burengero bw’uruzi Efurate, na Shetari Bozenayi na we nyene, hamwe n’abandi bakuru batwara iyo ntara, mwigire kure y’aho hantu. <verse eid="EZR 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 6:7" />Ntimuhungabanye iyubakwa ry’iyo Ngoro y’Imana. Nimureke umukuru w’Abayuda n’abatware babo basubire bayubake mu kibanza yahozemwo.<verse eid="EZR 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 6:8" />Vyongeye, ntanze itegeko ryerekeye ivyo muzokorera abo bakuru b’Abayuda bijanye no kwubaka Ingoro y’Imana:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 6:8">Amahera yose bazokoresha aze arihwe avuye mu butunzi bw’i bwami, buva mu matagisi atozwa mu burengero bw’uruzi Efurate, kugira ngo ico gikorwa ntigihagarare. <verse eid="EZR 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 6:9" />Ibikenewe vyose: amashuri, impfizi z’intama hamwe n’imyagazi y’intama bitangwa nk’ibimazi vyo guturirwa bishikanirwa Imana yo mw’ijuru, ingano, umunyu, umuvinyu n’amavuta, nk’uko bisabwa n’abaherezi i Yerusalemu, baze babihabwe imisi yose ata na kimwe kibuze, <verse eid="EZR 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 6:10" />kugira ngo bashobore gushikanira ibimazi bihimbara Imana yo mw’ijuru bongera basengera umwami n’abahungu biwe kugira ngo bamererwe neza.<verse eid="EZR 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 6:11" />Ikindi, ntegetse ko nihagira umuntu n’umwe arenga kuri iri tegeko, bazoce bakura inkingi mu nzu yiwe bayimumanikeko kandi inzu yiwe ize ihindurwe umusaka. <verse eid="EZR 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 6:12" />Imana, yo yagenye ko izina ryayo riba aho hantu, ize ikure ku ngoma umwami wese canke ihanga ryose rizoramvurira ukuboko guhindura iri tegeko canke gusambura iyi Ngoro y’i Yerusalemu.</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 6:12">Jewe Dariyusi nshinze iki cagezwe. Nigishirwe mu ngiro uku nyene gishinzwe ata guca i ruhande.<verse eid="EZR 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baheza kwubaka Ingoro, bayishikiriza Imana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 6:13" />Hanyuma, kubera ico cagezwe c’umwami Dariyusi, Tatenayi, umukuru w’intara yo mu burengero bw’uruzi Efurate na Shetari Bozenayi n’abo bari bafatanije bagishira mu ngiro ata co bahinduye. <verse eid="EZR 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 6:14" />Nuko Abarongozi b’Abayuda babandanya kwubaka kandi bagenda batera imbere barongowe n’ubutumwa bw’uwavugishwa n’Imana Hagayi na Zakariya, wo mu ruvyaro rwa Ido. Barangiza kwubaka iyo Ngoro nk’uko Imana y’Abisirayeli yategetse kandi nk’uko Kuro, Dariyusi na Aritazeruzi, abami b’i Buperesi, bari babitegetse. <verse eid="EZR 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 6:15" />Ingoro y’Imana yahejeje kwubakwa ku musi ugira gatatu w’ukwezi kwa Adari, mu mwaka ugira gatandatu umwami Dariyusi ari ku ngoma.<verse eid="EZR 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 6:16" />Nuko Abisirayeli, abaherezi, Abalewi n’abandi bose bari baravuye mu kinyago, bahimbaza umusi mukuru wo gushikiriza Imana Ingoro yayo banezerewe. <verse eid="EZR 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 6:17" />Mu gushikiriza iyo Ngoro y’Imana batanga amashuri y’inka ijana, impfizi z’intama amajana abiri, imyagazi y’intama amajana ane, hamwe n’ikimazi gitangirwa ivyaha vy’Abisirayeli bose kigizwe n’amasuguru y’impene icumi n’abiri, imw’imwe ku muryango wose w’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="EZR 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 6:18" />Baca bashiraho abaherezi mu mice yabo n’Abalewi mu migwi yabo ngo bakore igikorwa c’Imana i Yerusalemu, nk’uko vyari vyanditswe mu gitabu ca Mose.<verse eid="EZR 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bahimbaza Pasika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 6:19" />Ku musi ugira icumi na kane w’ukwezi kwa mbere, Abavuye mu kinyago bahimbaza Pasika. <verse eid="EZR 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 6:20" />Abaherezi n’Abalewi bari bihumanuye bejejwe neza. Abalewi bakererera umwagazi w’intama wa Pasika abavuye mu kinyago bose, benewabo b’abaherezi hamwe na bo nyene ubwabo. <verse eid="EZR 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 6:21" />Nuko Abisirayeli bari bagarutse bavuye mu kinyago barawurya, hamwe n’abo bose bari bitandukanije n’ibikorwa bihumanya vyakorwa n’abanyamahanga babana na bo kugira ngo barondere mu nyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana y’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="EZR 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 6:22" />Bamara imisi indwi bahimbaza umusi mukuru w’imikate itarimwo umwambiro kandi banezerewe kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yabujuje umunezero mu guhindura ivyiyumviro vy’umwami w’i Ashuri, kugira ngo abafashe mu gikorwa co kwubaka Ingoro y’Imana, Imana y’Abisirayeli.<verse eid="EZR 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EZR 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ezira aza i Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 7:1" />Inyuma y’ivyo, ku ngoma ya Ahasuwerusi umwami w’i Buperesi, haza Ezira mwene Seraya, Seraya mwene Azariya, Azariya mwene Hilukiya, <verse eid="EZR 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 7:2" />Hilukiya mwene Shalumu, Shalumu mwene Sadoki, Sadoki mwene Ahitubu, <verse eid="EZR 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 7:3" />Ahitubu mwene Amariya, Amariya mwene Azariya, Azariya mwene Merayoti, <verse eid="EZR 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 7:4" />Merayoti mwene Zerahiya, Zerahiya mwene Uzi, Uzi mwene Buki, <verse eid="EZR 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 7:5" />Buki mwene Abishuwa, Abishuwa mwene Finehasi, Finehasi wene Eliyazeri, Eliyazeri mwene Aroni umuherezi mukuru. <verse eid="EZR 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 7:6" />Uwo Ezira aduga avuye i Babiloni. Yari umwigisha yize neza Ivyagezwe vya Mose, ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana y’Abisirayeli yari yaratanze. Umwami yari yamuhaye ivyo yari yamusavye vyose, kuko ukuboko kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yiwe kwari kuri we. <verse eid="EZR 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 7:7" />Bamwe mu Bisirayeli, harimwo n’abaherezi, Abalewi, abaririmvyi, abarinzi b’irembo n’abakozi bo mu Ngoro, na bo nyene baraduga i Yerusalemu mu mwaka ugira indwi umwami Ahasuwerusi ari ku ngoma.<verse eid="EZR 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 7:8" />Ezira ashika i Yerusalemu mu kwezi kugira gatanu kw’umwaka ugira indwi uwo mwami ari ku ngoma. <verse eid="EZR 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 7:9" />Yari yavuye i Babiloni ku musi wa mbere w’ukwezi kwa mbere, ashika i Yerusalemu ku musi wa mbere w’ukwezi kwa gatanu, kuko ukuboko kw’ubuntu bw’Imana kwari kuri we. <verse eid="EZR 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 7:10" />Kandi Ezira yari yariyeguriye kwiga no kwitondera Ivyagezwe vy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> no kwigisha ivyo yihanikirije n’amabwirizwa yatanze mu Bisirayeli.<verse eid="EZR 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikete umwami Aritazeruzi yandikiye Ezira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 7:11" />Iyi ni ikopi y’ikete umwami Ahasuwerusi yahaye Ezira umuherezi n’umwigisha w’Ivyagezwe, umuntu yanonosoye ivyerekeye amabwirizwa n’amategeko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yahaye Abisirayeli:<verse eid="EZR 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 7:12" />Jewe Aritazeruzi, umwami w’abami,</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 7:12">Kuri Ezira umuherezi, umwigisha w’Ivyagezwe vy’Imana yo mw’ijuru:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 7:12">Ndakuramukije.<verse eid="EZR 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 7:13" />Ubu rero ntegetse ko Umwisirayeli wese ari mu bwami bwanje, harimwo n’abaherezi n’Abalewi, bipfuza kuja i Yerusalemu bajanye nawe, bashobora kugenda. <verse eid="EZR 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 7:14" />Urungitswe n’umwami hamwe n’abahanuzi biwe indwi ngo uje gutohoza neza ivyerekeye i Buyuda n’i Yerusalemu ku bijanye n’Ivyagezwe vy’Imana yanyu, biri mu maboko yawe. <verse eid="EZR 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 7:15" />Vyongeye, uze ujane ifeza n’inzahabu ivyo umwami n’abahanuzi biwe bashikaniye Imana y’Abisirayeli iba i Yerusalemu bavyishakiye, <verse eid="EZR 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 7:16" />hamwe n’ifeza n’inzahabu ushobora kuronka mu ntara y’i Babiloni, hamwe n’amashikanwa yose abantu n’abaherezi bazotanga ku bw’Ingoro y’Imana yabo iri i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="EZR 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 7:17" />Muri ayo mahera, uze uguremwo amashuri y’inka, impfizi z’intama n’imyagazi y’intama, hamwe n’amashikanwa y’ifu n’ay’ibinyobwa, maze ubishikane ku gicaniro kiri mu Ngoro y’Imana yanyu i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="EZR 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 7:18" />Wewe na benewanyu b’Abayuda mushobora gukoresha ico cose muzobona ko kibereye ifeza n’inzahabu bizosigara, mwisunze ivyo Imana yanyu igomba. <verse eid="EZR 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 7:19" />Uze utereke imbere y’Imana y’i Yerusalemu ibikoresho vyose wahawe vyo gutazirisha Imana mu Ngoro y’Imana yanyu. <verse eid="EZR 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 7:20" />Muze mukure mu nzu y’ubutunzi bw’umwami ivyo muzokenera gukoresha ku bw’iyo Ngoro y’Imana yawe.<verse eid="EZR 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 7:21" />Ubu rero, jewe umwami Aritazeruzi, ntegetse abazezwabintu bose bo hakurya y’uruzi Efurate ngo batange ivyo Ezira umuherezi, umwigisha w’Ivyagezwe vy’Imana yo mw’ijuru, azobasaba vyose, <verse eid="EZR 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 7:22" />gushika kw’italanto ijana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 3.750.</char></note> z’ifeza, ingero koru ijana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amatoni 18.</char></note> z’ingano, ingero batu ijana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amalitiro 2.200.</char></note> z’umuvinyu, ingero batu ijana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amalitiro 2.200.</char></note> z’amavuta ya elayo hamwe n’umunyu wose ukenewe. <verse eid="EZR 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 7:23" />Ikintu cose Imana yo mw’ijuru yategetse, kize gikorwe uko nyene gitegetswe ata gihazemwo ku bw’iyo Ngoro y’Imana yo mw’ijuru. Ni iki cotuma dukwegera uburake bwayo umwami n’abahungu biwe? <verse eid="EZR 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 7:24" />Mumenye kandi ko mutemerewe kwaka itagisi, ishikanwa ryo kwisaba canke ikori umuherezi n’umwe canke Abalewi, abaririmvyi, abarinzi b’irembo, abakozi bo mu Ngoro canke abandi bose bakora muri iyo Ngoro.<verse eid="EZR 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 7:25" />Nawe, Ezira, ukoresheje ubwenge usanganywe bw’Imana yawe, uze utoranye abacamanza bakuru n’abandi basanzwe kugira ngo bacire imanza abantu bose bo mu burengero bw’uruzi Efurate; abantu bose bazi Ivyagezwe vy’Imana yawe. Kandi uze uyigishe abatayazi bose. <verse eid="EZR 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 7:26" />Umuntu wese atazokwumvira Ivyagezwe vy’Imana yawe n’amategeko y’umwami aze ahanishwe igihano co gupfa, kwirukanwa mu gihugu, kunyagwa itongo, canke gushirwa mw’ibohero.<verse eid="EZR 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 7:27" />Nihashimwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya ba sogokuruza, we yashize ku mutima w’umwami guhezagira Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> iri i Yerusalemu muri ubu buryo <verse eid="EZR 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 7:28" />kandi yangiriye ubuntu bungana gutya imbere y’umwami n’abahanuzi biwe n’abandi bashizwe hejuru bo mu bwami bwiwe. Kubera ukuboko kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanje kwari kuri jewe, narumvise ko ndemye, maze ndegeranya abantu barongora abandi bava muri Isirayeli ngo badugane nanje.<verse eid="EZR 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EZR 8" />
  <para style="s1">Urutonde rw’abakuru b’imiryango bagarukanye na Ezira</para>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 8:1" />Aba ni bo bakuru b’imiryango hamwe n’abo bandikanywe, twaduganye tuvuye i Babiloni ku ngoma y’umwami Ahasuwerusi.<verse eid="EZR 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 8:2" />Mu bakomoka kuri Finehasi ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:2">Gerishomu.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 8:2">Mu bakomoka kuri Itamari ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:2">Daniyeli.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 8:2">Mu bakomoka kuri Dawidi ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:2">Hatushi <verse eid="EZR 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 8:3" />yakomotse kuri Shekaniya;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 8:3">mu bakomoka kuri Paroshi ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:3">Zakariya n’abagabo ijana na mirongo itanu bari banditswe hamwe na we.<verse eid="EZR 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 8:4" />Mu bakomoka kuri Pahati-Mowabu ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:4">Eliyehowenayi mwene Zerahiya, yari kumwe n’abagabo amajana abiri.<verse eid="EZR 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 8:5" />Mu bakomoka kuri Zatu ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:5">Shekaniya mwene Yahaziyeli, n’abagabo amajana atatu bari kumwe na we.<verse eid="EZR 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 8:6" />Mu bakomoka kuri Adini ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:6">Ebedi mwene Yonatani, n’abagabo mirongo itanu bari kumwe na we.<verse eid="EZR 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 8:7" />Mu bakomoka kuri Elamu ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:7">Yeshaya mwene Ataliya, n’abagabo mirongo indwi bari kumwe na we.<verse eid="EZR 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 8:8" />Mu bakomoka kuri Shefatiya ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:8">Zebadiya mwene Mikayeli, n’abagabo mirongo umunani bari kumwe na we.<verse eid="EZR 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 8:9" />Mu bakomotse kuri Yowabu ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:9">Obadiya mwene Yehiyeli, n’abagabo amajana abiri na cumi n’umunani bari kumwe na we.<verse eid="EZR 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 8:10" />Mu bakomoka kuri Bani ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:10">Shelomiti mwene Yosifiya, n’abagabo ijana na mirongo itandatu bari kumwe na we.<verse eid="EZR 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 8:11" />Mu bakomoka kuri Bebayi ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:11">Zakariya mwene Bebayi, n’abagabo mirongo ibiri n’umunani bari kumwe na we.<verse eid="EZR 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 8:12" />Mu bakomoka kuri Azigadi ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:12">Yohanani mwene Hakatani, n’abagabo ijana na cumi bari kumwe na we.<verse eid="EZR 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 8:13" />Mu bakomoka kuri Adonikamu ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:13">abanyuma muri uwo muryango; amazina yabo akaba yari Elifeleti, Yeweli na Shemaya, n’abagabo mirongo itandatu bari kumwe na bo.<verse eid="EZR 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 8:14" />Mu bakomoka kuri Bigivayi ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:14">Utayi na Zakuri, n’abagabo mirongo indwi bari kumwe na bo.<verse eid="EZR 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gusubira i Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 8:15" />Ndabakoraniriza ku mugezi utemba uja Ahava, aho hantu tuhamara imisi itatu. Maze kuraba neza mu bantu no mu baherezi, nsanga nta Mulewi n’umwe arimwo. <verse eid="EZR 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 8:16" />Nuko ntoranya Eliyezeri, Ariyeli, Shemaya, Elunatani, Yaribu, Elunatani, Natani, Zakariya na Meshulamu, bari abarongozi, na Yoyaribu na Elunatani, bari abantu b’incabwenge, <verse eid="EZR 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 8:17" />maze ndabarungika kwa Ido, umutware w’i Kasifiya. Ndababwira ivyo baza kubwira Ido na benewabo, abakozi bo mu Ngoro bari i Kasifiya, kugira ngo baturungikire abakozi bo kudufasha igikorwa co mu Ngoro y’Imana yacu. <verse eid="EZR 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 8:18" />Kubera ukuboko kw’ubuntu bw’Imana yacu kwari kumwe natwe, baturungikira Sherebiya, umuntu afise ugutahura, wo mu bakomotse kuri Mahuli mwene Lewi, Lewi mwene Isirayeli, n’abahungu n’abavukanyi ba Sherebiya, abagabo icumi n’umunani; <verse eid="EZR 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 8:19" />na Hashabiya, hamwe na Yeshaya wo mu bakomotse kuri Merari, n’abavukanyi biwe n’abahungwabo, abagabo mirongo ibiri. <verse eid="EZR 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 8:20" />Bazana n’abandi amajana abiri na mirongo ibiri b’abakozi bo mu Ngoro, urwego Dawidi n’abaganwa biwe bari barashizeho ngo bafashe Abalewi. Bose barandikwa amazina.<verse eid="EZR 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 8:21" />Aho nyene ku nkombe z’umugezi uja muri Ahava, menyesha abantu ko bisonzesha, kugira ngo twicishe bugufi imbere y’Imana yacu duheze tuyisabe iduhe kugira urugendo rwiza twebwe n’abana bacu, n’ivyo dutunze vyose. <verse eid="EZR 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 8:22" />Kuko vyaranteye isoni gusaba umwami ingabo n’abagendera ku mafarasi bo kudukingira abansi bodutegera mu nzira, kandi twari twarabwiye umwami ko ukuboko kw’ubuntu bw’Imana yacu kuri kumwe n’umuntu wese amuhanze amaso, ariko ko uburake bwiwe buri ku bamutera ibitugu. <verse eid="EZR 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 8:23" />Nuko turisonzesha twinginga Imana yacu ku bw’ivyo, na yo yishura ugusenga kwacu.<verse eid="EZR 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 8:24" />Maze ntoranya abaherezi icumi na babiri bo kuturongora, bari kumwe na Sherebiya, Hashabiya n’abandi icumi bo muri benewabo, <verse eid="EZR 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 8:25" />ndabapimira za feza n’inzahabu zo gushikana na vya bikoresho umwami, abahanuzi biwe, abatware biwe n’Abisirayeli bose bari ngaho bari batangiye Ingoro y’Imana yacu. <verse eid="EZR 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 8:26" />Ndabapimira italanto amajana atandatu na mirongo itanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amatoni 24.</char></note> z’ifeza, ibikoresho bikozwe mw’ifeza bingana n’italanto ijana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 3.750.</char></note>, n’izindi ijana z’inzahabu, <verse eid="EZR 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 8:27" />ibikombe mirongo ibiri vy’inzahabu vy’agaciro kangana n’ingero dariki igihumbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 8,4.</char></note>, n’ibikoresho bikozwe mu mwakaka usenye neza bifise agaciro nk’inzahabu.<verse eid="EZR 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 8:28" />Ndababwira nti: “Mwebwe n’ibi bikoresho mwejerejwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Ifeza n’inzahabu ni ishikanwa ryahawe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya ba sogokuruza n’umutima ubikunze. <verse eid="EZR 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 8:29" />Mubizigame neza kugeza mubipimye mugeze mu vyumba vy’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> i Yerusalemu imbere y’abakuru b’abaherezi n’Abalewi n’abakuru b’imiryango y’Abisirayeli.” <verse eid="EZR 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 8:30" />Nuko abaherezi n’Abalewi bakira izo feza n’inzahabu n’ivyo bikoresho vyejejwe vyari vyateguriwe kujanwa mu Ngoro y’Imana yacu i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="EZR 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 8:31" />Ku musi ugira icumi na kabiri w’ukwezi kwa mbere tuva kuri wa mugezi uja muri Ahava tuja i Yerusalemu. Ukuboko kw’Imana yacu kwari kuri twebwe, maze iratuzigama iturinda abansi n’abambuzi mu rugendo rwose. <verse eid="EZR 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 8:32" />Maze dushika i Yerusalemu, tuharuhukira imisi itatu.<verse eid="EZR 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 8:33" />Ku musi ugira kane, mu Ngoro y’Imana yacu, dupima za feza n’inzahabu na vya bikoresho vyejejwe tubiha Meremoti mwene Uriya, umuherezi. Eliyazeri mwene Finehasi yari kumwe na we, hamwe n’Abalewi Yozabadi mwene Yesuwa na Nowadiya mwene Binuwi. <verse eid="EZR 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 8:34" />Vyose vyarapimwe biraharurwa, maze ibipimo vyose birandikwa muri ico gihe.<verse eid="EZR 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 8:35" />Maze abagarutse bavuye mu kinyago bashikanira Imana y’Abisirayeli ibimazi vyo guturirwa n’umuriro: amashuri y’inka icumi n’abiri kubw’Abisirayeli bose, impfizi z’intama mirongo icenda na zitandatu, imyagazi y’intama mirongo indwi n’indwi n’amasuguru y’impene cumi n’abiri y’ikimazi c’ivyaha. Ivyo vyose vyari ibimazi vyo guturirwa n’umuriro bishikaniwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="EZR 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 8:36" />Kandi bashikiriza ya mategeko y’umwami abishikira b’umwami n’abakuru b’intara bo hakurya y’uruzi Efurate, na bo baca bafasha abantu baterera n’Ingoro y’Imana.<verse eid="EZR 8:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EZR 9" />
  <para style="s1">Isengesho rya Ezira ku bubakanye n’abanyamahangakazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 9:1" />Ivyo vyose bimaze gukorwa, abarongozi baza aho ndi baravuga bati: “Abisirayeli, harimwo n’abaherezi n’Abalewi, ntibitandukanije n’abanyamahanga babana mu gihugu hamwe n’imigenzo yabo mibi birenze urugero, nk’iy’Abanyakanani, Abaheti, Abaperizi, Abayebusi, Abamoni, Abanyamowabu, Abanyegiputa n’Abamori. <verse eid="EZR 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 9:2" />Abagabo b’Abisirayeli babatoyemwo abakobwa babagira abagore babo kandi babakwera n’abahungu babo na bo. Ivyo vyatumye haba ikivange c’ubwoko bwera n’ayo mahanga. Kandi abarongozi n’abacamanza ni bo babaye aba mbere gukora ico kizira.”<verse eid="EZR 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 9:3" />Numvise ivyo, nitabagurirako umwambaro wanje n’ikoti, nishikura umushatsi n’ubwanwa, hanyuma nicara hasi mbabaye cane. <verse eid="EZR 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 9:4" />Abantu bose bajugumizwa n’amajambo y’Imana y’Abisirayeli baza aho ndi barankikuza kubera ico kibi abagarutse bava mu kinyago bakoze. Maze nguma ngaho nicurikiriye kugeza igihe co gutanga ikimazi co ku mugoroba.<verse eid="EZR 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 9:5" />Nuko hageze gutanga ikimazi co ku mugoroba, mpaguruka aho nari nicurikiririye, umwambaro wanje n’umutamana wanje vyatabutse, nca mpfukama hasi nduza amaboko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanje <verse eid="EZR 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 9:6" />ndaheza ndasenga nti:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 9:6">“Ewe Mana yanje, maramajwe cane kandi nteterejwe no kukurangamiza, kuko ivyaha vyacu ari vyinshi kugeza n’aho bidusumba kandi igicumuro cacu cashitse mw’ijuru. <verse eid="EZR 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 9:7" />Kuva mu misi ya ba sogokuruza gushika n’ubu, ukugabitanya kwacu kwamye ari kwinshi. Kubera ivyaha vyacu, twebwe n’abami bacu n’abaherezi bacu bagerewe inkota no kuba inyagano, kunyagwa ivyacu no gucurangurizwa mu maboko y’abami b’amahanga, nk’uko bimeze uwu musi.<verse eid="EZR 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 9:8" />Ariko noneho, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu, muri kano kanya gato, ahejeje kutugirira ubuntu mu kudusigariza amasigarira no kuduha ikibanza gikomeye mu ngoro yiwe yera, ku bw’ivyo Imana yacu ikaba itumurikiye kandi iduhaye agahengwe mu buja bwacu. <verse eid="EZR 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 9:9" />Naho turi abagurano, Imana yacu ntiyaduhebeye mu buja bwacu. Yatweretse ukugira neza kwayo imbere y’abami b’i Buperesi: Yadusubije ubuzima bushasha ngo dusubire kwubaka Ingoro y’Imana yacu no gusanura aho yasambutse, kandi yaduhaye uruzitiro rwo kudukingira i Buyuda n’i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="EZR 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 9:10" />Ariko ubu, ewe Mana yacu, twovuga iki inyuma y’ivyo? Ko twakengereye amabwirizwa yawe <verse eid="EZR 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 9:11" />watanze ucishije mu bavugishwa bawe aho wavuga uti: Igihugu mugiye kwinjiramwo ngo mucegukire ni igihugu candujwe n’abantu bakibamwo. Bacujuje ibihumanya vyabo kuva ku mpera gushika ku yindi ku bw’ibikorwa vyabo bibi. <verse eid="EZR 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 9:12" />Nuko rero, ntimuze mukoshe abakobwa banyu ku bahungu babo canke ngo musabire abahungu banyu abakobwa babo. Ntimuze mwigere mugiranira amasezerano y’ubugenzi na bo, kugira ngo mube abanyenkomezi kandi murye ivyiza vyo mu gihugu muze mukirage abana banyu nk’umugabane w’ibihe bidashira.<verse eid="EZR 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 9:13" />Ivyadushitseko ni ingaruka y’ibikorwa vyacu bibi n’ukugabitanya kwacu gukomeye, ariko n’ubwo biri uko, Mana yacu waduhanye buhoro ugereranije n’ivyo twakoze kandi waduhaye amasigarira nk’aya. <verse eid="EZR 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 9:14" />None twosubira kugarariza amabwirizwa yawe tugahana abageni na ya mahanga yakora ibibi vy’akaburarugero? Mbega ntivyotuma uraka bigatuma uturandura, ntudusigire amasigarira canke n’uwocika kw’icumu? <verse eid="EZR 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 9:15" />Ewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Mana y’Abisirayeli, uragororotse! Uyu musi twasigaye nk’amasigarira. Turi hano imbere yawe dutsinzwe n’ivyo twakoze, naho ata woshobora guhagarara imbere y’inyonga zawe ku bw’ivyaha vyiwe.”<verse eid="EZR 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EZR 10" />
  <para style="s1">Abantu batura icaha cabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 10:1" />Ezira agisenga yatura, arira yubamye imbere y’Ingoro y’Imana, abantu benshi b’Abisirayeli, abagabo, abagore n’abana, bakoranira aho ari. Na bo nyene bararira cane. <verse eid="EZR 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 10:2" />Nuko Shekaniya mwene Yehiyeli, umwe wo mu bakomoka kuri Elamu, abwira Ezira ati: “Ntitwabaye abizigirwa imbere y’Imana yacu mu kurongora abagore b’abanyamahangakazi dukuye mu mahanga adukikije. Ariko naho bimeze uko, haracariho ivyizigiro ku Bisirayeli. <verse eid="EZR 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 10:3" />Ubu rero, nimuze dusezeranire imbere y’Imana yacu, twemere kwirukana abo bagore bose n’abana babo, nk’uko wewe nyakwubahwa ubiduhanura n’abandi bose bahindira agashitsi imbere y’amabwirizwa y’Uhoraho Imana yacu. Kandi tubikore twisunze ivyagezwe. <verse eid="EZR 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 10:4" />Haguruka; iki kibazo kiri mu maboko yawe. Natwe turagushigikiye, komera kandi ubikore.”<verse eid="EZR 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 10:5" />Nuko Ezira aca ava hasi arahiza abakuru mu baherezi n’Abalewi n’Abisirayeli bose ngo bakore ivyo vyavuzwe. Bose bararahira. <verse eid="EZR 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 10:6" />Maze Ezira aca ava imbere y’Ingoro y’Imana aja mu cumba ca Yehohanani mwene Eliyashibu. Ari ngaho, ntiyariye ikintu na kimwe kandi ntiyanyoye n’amazi, kuko yabandanije agandaye kubera ubuhemu abavuye mu kinyago bagize.<verse eid="EZR 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 10:7" />Nuko babimenyesha mu Buyuda hose n’i Yerusalemu ngo abagarutse bavuye mu kinyago bakoranire hamwe i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="EZR 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 10:8" />Umuntu wese atashoboye kuboneka mu misi itatu yaca anyagwa itongo ryiwe, nk’uko vyari vyashinzwe n’abatware hamwe n’abakuru b’imiryango, kandi na we nyene ubwiwe agaca akurwa mw’ikoraniro ry’abagarutse bavuye mu kinyago.<verse eid="EZR 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 10:9" />Mu misi itatu, abagabo bose b’i Buyuda n’i Bubenyamini bari bakoraniye i Yerusalemu, maze ku musi wa mirongo ibiri w’ukwezi kw’icenda, abantu bose bari bicaye mu kibuga c’Ingoro y’Imana, batetemera kubera iyo ngorane hamwe rero n’imvura nyinshi. <verse eid="EZR 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 10:10" />Nuko Ezira umuherezi arahaguruka arababwira ati: “Ntimwabaye abizigirwa; mwarongoye abagore b’abanyamahangakazi, mwongereza ku bibi Abisirayeli bari barakoze. <verse eid="EZR 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 10:11" />None rero nimwaturire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya ba sogokuruza icaha canyu, kandi mukore ivyo agomba. Mwitandukanye n’abanyamahanga mubana n’abagore mwazanye b’abanyamahangakazi.”<verse eid="EZR 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 10:12" />Ikoraniro ryose ririshura n’ijwi rirenga riti: “Uvuze ukuri! Turakora nk’uko uvuze. <verse eid="EZR 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 10:13" />Ariko hano hari abantu benshi kandi ni mu gihe c’imvura; kubera ivyo ntidushobora guhagarara hanze. Ikigeretse kuri ivyo, ibi ntibishobora gutunganywa ku musi umwe canke ibiri, kuko twakoze icaha gikomeye mu gukora ivyo. <verse eid="EZR 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 10:14" />Abatware bacu nibabikore mu gishingo c’ikoraniro ryose. Maze umuntu wese wo mu bisagara vyacu yarongoye umunyamahangakazi mu gihe kinaka cemejwe, azoze azananye n’abakuru n’abacamanza bo mu gisagara kimwe cose, kugira ngo uburake bw’inkazi bw’Imana yacu bwatewe n’iyi ngorane bushobore kutuvako.” <verse eid="EZR 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 10:15" />Yonatani mwene Asaheli na Yahizeya mwene Tikuva ni bo bonyene bagwanije iyo ngingo, bashigikiwe na Meshulamu na Shabetayi Umulewi.<verse eid="EZR 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 10:16" />Nuko abatahutse bavuye mu kinyago bakora nk’uko bagiriwe inama. Ezira umuherezi atoranya abagabo bari abakuru b’imiryango, umw’umwe mu muce w’umuryango, kandi abagabo bose babavuga mu mazina. Ku musi wa mbere w’ukwezi kw’icumi baricara ngo bige ivyo bintu, <verse eid="EZR 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 10:17" />kandi kugeza ku musi wa mbere w’ukwezi kwa mbere baraheza kwihweza ivyerekeye abagabo bose bari barongoye abagore b’abanyamahangakazi.<verse eid="EZR 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abatsinzwe n’icaha co kurongora abanyamahangakazi</para>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 10:18" />Mu bakomotse ku baherezi, aba bakurikira ni bo bari bararongoye abanyamahangakazi:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 10:18">Mu bakomoka kuri Yesuwa mwene Yozadaki, n’abavukanyi biwe ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:18">Mayaseya, Eliyezeri, Yaribu na Gedaliya. <verse eid="EZR 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 10:19" />(Bose basezerana mu ndahiro kwirukana abagore babo, no gutanga impfizi y’intama ivuye mu mukuku ngo ibe ikimazi co kwisaba ku bw’icaha cabo.)<verse eid="EZR 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 10:20" />Mu bakomoka kuri Imeri ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:20">Hanani na Zebadiya.<verse eid="EZR 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 10:21" />Mu bakomoka kuri Harimu ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:21">Mayaseya, Eliya, Shemaya, Yehiyeli na Uziya.<verse eid="EZR 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 10:22" />Mu bakomoka kuri Pashuri ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:22">Eliyowenayi, Mayaseya, Ishimayeli, Netaneli, Yozabadi na Elasa.<verse eid="EZR 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 10:23" />Mu Balewi ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:23">Yozabadi, Shimeyi, Kelaya ari we Kelita, Petahiya, Yuda na Eliyezeri.<verse eid="EZR 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 10:24" />Mu baririmvyi ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:24">Eliyashibu.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 10:24">Mu barinzi b’irembo ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:24">Shalumu, Telemu na Uri.<verse eid="EZR 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 10:25" />Mu bakomotse ku bandi Bisirayeli:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 10:25">Mu bakomoka kuri Paroshi ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:25">Ramiya, Iziya, Malikiya, Miyamini, Eliyazeri, Malikiya na Benaya.<verse eid="EZR 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 10:26" />Mu bakomoka kuri Elamu ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:26">Mataniya, Zakariya, Yehiyeli, Abudi, Yeremoti na Eliya.<verse eid="EZR 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 10:27" />Mu bakomoka kuri Zatu ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:27">Eliyowenayi, Eliyashibu, Mataniya, Yeremoti, Zabadi na Aziza.<verse eid="EZR 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 10:28" />Mu bakomoka kuri Bebayi ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:28">Yehohanani, Hananiya, Zabayi na Atilayi.<verse eid="EZR 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 10:29" />Mu bakomoka kuri Bani ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:29">Meshulamu, Maluki, Adaya, Yashubi, Sheyali na Yeremoti.<verse eid="EZR 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 10:30" />Mu bakomoka kuri Pahati-Mowabu ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:30">Adina, Kelali, Benaya, Mayaseya, Mataniya, Bezaleli, Binuwi na Manase.<verse eid="EZR 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 10:31" />Mu bakomoka kuri Harimu ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:31">Eliyezeri, Ishiya, Malikiya, Shemaya, Shimeyoni, <verse eid="EZR 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 10:32" />Benyamini, Maluki na Shemariya.<verse eid="EZR 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 10:33" />Mu bakomoka kuri Hashumi ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:33">Matenayi, Matata, Zabadi, Elifeleti, Yeremayi, Manase na Shimeyi.<verse eid="EZR 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 10:34" />Mu bakomoka kuri Bani ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:34">Mayadayi, Amuramu, Uweli, <verse eid="EZR 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 10:35" />Benaya, Bedeya, Keluhi, <verse eid="EZR 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 10:36" />Vaniya, Meremoti, Eliyashibu, <verse eid="EZR 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 10:37" />Mataniya, Matenayi na Yayasu.<verse eid="EZR 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 10:38" />Mu bakomoka kuri Binuwi ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:38">Shimeyi, <verse eid="EZR 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 10:39" />Shelemiya, Natani, Adaya, <verse eid="EZR 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 10:40" />Makinadebayi, Shashayi, Sharayi, <verse eid="EZR 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 10:41" />Azareli, Shelemiya, Shemariya, <verse eid="EZR 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 10:42" />Shalumu, Amariya na Yosefu.<verse eid="EZR 10:42" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 10:43" />Mu bakomoka kuri Nebo ni</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:43">Yeyiyeli, Matitiya, Zabadi, Zebina, Yadayi, Yoweli na Benaya.<verse eid="EZR 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 10:44" />Abo bagabo bose bari bararongoye abanyamahangakazi kandi bamwe muri bo bari bafitaniye abana n’abo bagore.<verse eid="EZR 10:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 10" />
</usx>